# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: VargaMarionPath | Scene: MarionPath2

translate fr strings:

    old "A crown her family still wore, to this day."
    new "Une couronne que sa famille portait encore, à ce jour."

    old "A few did not attend."
    new "Quelques-uns n'étaient pas venus."

    old "A part of her wanted to resist it, but Sarah also knew that he was right."
    new "Une partie d'elle voulait résister, mais Sarah savait aussi qu'il avait raison."

    old "A child, born from her family and his. The final seal that would forever link their houses."
    new "Un enfant, né de leur union. Le sceau final qui lierait leurs maisons pour toujours."

    old "A child that would guarantee peace and stability."
    new "Un enfant qui garantirait la paix et la stabilité."

    old "A moment later, the servants arrived and began to help her get dressed."
    new "Un instant plus tard, les domestiques arrivèrent et commencèrent à l'aider à s'habiller."

    old "A growing confidence in himself."
    new "Une confiance grandissante en lui-même."

    old "A claim that Oliver could use as a pretext to take offense."
    new "Un prétexte que Oliver pourrait utiliser pour prendre ombrage."

    old "A lot of trade goes through it, and he taxes it."
    new "Beaucoup de commerce passe par là, et il y taxe."

    old "Summon Oliver to court"
    new "Faire comparaître Oliver au tribunal"

    old "Do not punish Oliver"
    new "Ne punis pas Oliver"

    old "A lovely spot, surrounded by vineyards."
    new "Un endroit charmant, entouré de vignobles."

    old "Accept her invitation"
    new "Accepter son invitation"

    old "Reject her invitation"
    new "Refuser sa invitation"

    old "Stand up to him"
    new "Lève-toi contre lui"

    old "Lower your gaze"
    new "Baissez les yeux"

    old "Submit to Marion"
    new "Se rendre à Marion"

    old "Resist Marion"
    new "Résister à Marion"
